1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,384
Look around.

2
00:00:01,384 --> 00:00:03,079
Phone cases, bottle caps,

3
00:00:03,079 --> 00:00:04,157
keyboard keys.

4
00:00:04,157 --> 00:00:05,698
Most of them were made

5
00:00:05,698 --> 00:00:07,112
the same way.

6
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,472
Injection molding.

7
00:00:08,472 --> 00:00:10,002
Pull the machine apart,

8
00:00:10,002 --> 00:00:11,678
and it has two main halves:

9
00:00:11,678 --> 00:00:12,917
an injection unit

10
00:00:12,917 --> 00:00:14,719
and a clamping unit.

11
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,052
Plastic pellets drop

12
00:00:16,052 --> 00:00:16,946
from the hopper

13
00:00:16,946 --> 00:00:18,568
into a heated barrel.

14
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,833
Inside, a reciprocating screw

15
00:00:20,833 --> 00:00:21,879
does two jobs.

16
00:00:21,879 --> 00:00:23,005
It turns to mix

17
00:00:23,005 --> 00:00:24,534
and melt the plastic.

18
00:00:24,534 --> 00:00:26,143
Then it slams forward

19
00:00:26,143 --> 00:00:27,760
like a plunger.

20
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:28,836
The melt shoots

21
00:00:28,836 --> 00:00:30,007
through the nozzle,

22
00:00:30,007 --> 00:00:30,918
down the sprue,

23
00:00:30,918 --> 00:00:32,024
along the runners,

24
00:00:32,024 --> 00:00:33,391
and through a tiny gate

25
00:00:33,391 --> 00:00:34,857
into the cavity.

26
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:35,976
The clamping unit

27
00:00:35,976 --> 00:00:37,590
holds the two mold halves shut

28
00:00:37,590 --> 00:00:39,335
against that pressure.

29
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,347
Then comes the longest step:

30
00:00:41,347 --> 00:00:41,990
cooling.

31
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:44,063
Water channels pull the heat out

32
00:00:44,063 --> 00:00:46,054
until the part is solid.

33
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:47,198
The mold opens,

34
00:00:47,198 --> 00:00:48,384
and ejector pins

35
00:00:48,384 --> 00:00:50,134
push the part free.

36
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:51,918
A typical cycle takes

37
00:00:51,918 --> 00:00:53,087
10 to 30 seconds.

38
00:00:53,087 --> 00:00:54,568
And one mold can have

39
00:00:54,568 --> 00:00:55,893
several cavities,

40
00:00:55,893 --> 00:00:56,983
so every cycle

41
00:00:56,983 --> 00:00:58,954
makes several parts.

42
00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:00,325
Clamp. Inject.

43
00:01:00,325 --> 00:01:01,226
Cool. Eject.

44
00:01:01,226 --> 00:01:03,601
Repeat, millions of times.
